      Engineer by choice. Passionate about systems programming, database
      architecture, and low-latency design. I learn fast, love hand-crafting
      reliable codebases, and obsess over micro-optimizations. Right now, I'm
      building embedded storage engines and speeding up mundane routines using
      SIMD.
    </p>

